{"id": "q0360", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "conservative", "audio_s": 14.49, "n_chunks": 15, "n_concurrent": 15, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.3909, "eot_read_ms": 21, "reference_answer": "Jimi Hendrix", "query": "\"After stints backing Little Richard and the Isley Brothers, who was discovered leading \"\"Jimmy James and the Blue Flames\"\" at the Caf Wha? in New York and taken to London on 26 September 1966 to make hit records?\"", "transcript": "After stints backing Little Richard and the Iley Brothers, he was discovered leading Jimmy James and the Blue Flames at the Cafe Wha? in New York and taken to London on 26 September 1966 to make hit records.", "mode": "local", "answer": "One day the dragon asked the baker if it could help. The baker smiled and said, \"Of course, little one. Would you like to learn how to make bread?\"The dragon nodded eagerly. \"Yes! I want to make the best bread in the whole valley!\"And so every morning, the dragon helped the baker mix the flour, add the water, and knead the dough. It learned about rising and baking, about the perfect temperature and the secret touch that made the crust golden and crisp.The villagers began to notice the small dragon at the bakery, its tiny claws dusted with flour, its scales shimmering in the sunlight. They would smile and wave, and some even brought their children to see the friendly dragon who baked alongside the baker.Word spread through the valley, and soon people came from far and wide just to taste the dragon's bread. It was said that each loaf held a little bit of magic, making everyone who ate it feel warm and happy inside.One day, a traveler passed through the valley and heard the legend of the dragon baker. He arrived early at the bakery, eager to find the secret behind the famous bread.When he saw the small dragon carefully placing a tray of golden loaves into the oven, he gasped in wonder.\"You're the one!\" he exclaimed.\"I am,\" said the dragon with a proud puff of steam. \"And I'm learning every day, just like you learn new things every day.\"The traveler smiled. \"Then let me be your apprentice too. Teach me how to bake with heart and soul.\"And so, the dragon welcomed another friend to its world of flour and fire, proving that even the smallest among us can create something truly special with kindness, patience, and a little bit of magic.", "answer_ms": 9499}
{"id": "q0365", "pool": "easy-fact", "tier": "conservative", "audio_s": 5.11, "n_chunks": 6, "n_concurrent": 6, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.3954, "eot_read_ms": 21, "reference_answer": "MARGARITA", "query": "Which cocktail comprises Tequila, Lime or Lemon juice, and Orange-flavoured liqueur?", "transcript": "Which cocktail comprises tequila, lime or lemon juice and orange-flavoured liqueur?", "mode": "local", "answer": "The cocktail you're describing sounds like a Margarita. It typically includes tequila, lime juice, and a sweet orange-flavored liqueur called triple sec or Cointreau.", "answer_ms": 859}
